{"id":"n90911-2-8","stage":1,"title":"둘째 · 老二","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90911-2-8-1","ko":"그 집에 둘째가 태어났다던데 아들이에요? 딸이에요?","zh":"听说那家又生了个孩子，是男孩吗？还是女孩？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"집에","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에","audio":"/audio/a007fc659cc1512ff2b3.mp3"}},{"text":"둘째가","meaning":"老二","explanation":"둘째：老二；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"둘째","audio":"/audio/d32fb19bd64f81d079e1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90911","senseId":"2","lemma":"둘째","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"둘째가","audio":"/audio/d9ec283057dae179ad05.mp3"}},{"text":"태어났다던데","meaning":"诞生，出生，降生；表示引用。","explanation":"태어나다：诞生，出生，降生；하다：表示引用；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”；던데：回顾亲历的情况，作为后文的背景或对比。","readings":[{"term":"태어나다","audio":"/audio/ecdb2b36d4c847de96f4.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72180","senseId":"1","lemma":"태어나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"태어났다던데","audio":"/audio/d6bc96eee5bae989535c.mp3"}},{"text":"아들이에요?","meaning":"儿子","explanation":"아들：儿子；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"아들","audio":"/audio/65e567305972e652430e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20240","senseId":"1","lemma":"아들","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아들이에요","audio":"/audio/9b11